  "description": "Make the most of your Dremel rotary tools with this innovative line of rotary accessories and attachments for home improvement projects, crafting, and workshop applications. Whether you’re looking to carve, engrave, cut, sand or grind, there is a Dremel accessory to get the job done with pinpoint precision. That's why our purpose-built Dremel accessories let you get your project right down to the last detail. Dremel accessories are also color-coded into usage categories to make it easier for you to select the right accessory for your project. This Multipurpose Accessory Set is a starter kit for rotary tool use, offering a breadth of high-quality accessories for woodworking and providing a complete kit to get you started with your Dremel rotary tool. Designed for makers, DIYers, and homeowners, the kit includes the patented EZ Lock accessory system with the EZ Twist nose cap wrench, EZ Lock mandrel, and EZ Lock cut-off wheels for quick accessory changes. The storage case features reusable storage bins and lift-out trays for organization of the included bits, including 412 Sanding Discs, 432 Sanding Band, and 431 Sanding Band. Compatible with all Dremel corded and cordless rotary tools, all accessories feature a 1/8” standard shank.",
